    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shuttle Mining</strong> is a <i>Noita</i>- and <i>Terraria</i>-inspired mining game. Craft your own unique lasers, burn, taze, and make things explode.\u00a0Explore a destructible underground world full of danger, upgrades, and wild laser experiments. <i>Shuttle Mining</i> mixes sandbox creativity with fast-paced chaos in a cozy pixel-art universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Lasers:</strong> In <i>Shuttle Mining</i>, you can create your own unique weapons by using modules. Some modules increase a bullet\u2019s size, some make it explosive, and others make it burn. There are nearly endless possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/bfcb9daf82d263ed8e9c23f5fb3d6597.poster.avif?t=1749984858\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/bfcb9daf82d263ed8e9c23f5fb3d6597.webm?t=1749984858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/bfcb9daf82d263ed8e9c23f5fb3d6597.mp4?t=1749984858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Enemies:</strong> In order to find new modules, you'll need to beat enemies and get the recipes and materials to build modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/ece5a7c63e2448af99d85b79099ad444.poster.avif?t=1749984858\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/ece5a7c63e2448af99d85b79099ad444.webm?t=1749984858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/ece5a7c63e2448af99d85b79099ad444.mp4?t=1749984858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mining:</strong> Using good lasers takes a lot of energy. To upgrade the player and your battery, you'll have to dig for ores and minerals and craft new items!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/b7c366853b0803bd2bc805d834f6f29e.poster.avif?t=1749984858\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/b7c366853b0803bd2bc805d834f6f29e.webm?t=1749984858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/b7c366853b0803bd2bc805d834f6f29e.mp4?t=1749984858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shuttle Mining</strong> is a <i>Noita</i>- and <i>Terraria</i>-inspired mining game. Craft your own unique lasers, burn, taze, and make things explode.\u00a0Explore a destructible underground world full of danger, upgrades, and wild laser experiments. <i>Shuttle Mining</i> mixes sandbox creativity with fast-paced chaos in a cozy pixel-art universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Lasers:</strong> In <i>Shuttle Mining</i>, you can create your own unique weapons by using modules. Some modules increase a bullet\u2019s size, some make it explosive, and others make it burn. There are nearly endless possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/bfcb9daf82d263ed8e9c23f5fb3d6597.poster.avif?t=1749984858\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/bfcb9daf82d263ed8e9c23f5fb3d6597.webm?t=1749984858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/bfcb9daf82d263ed8e9c23f5fb3d6597.mp4?t=1749984858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Enemies:</strong> In order to find new modules, you'll need to beat enemies and get the recipes and materials to build modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/ece5a7c63e2448af99d85b79099ad444.poster.avif?t=1749984858\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/ece5a7c63e2448af99d85b79099ad444.webm?t=1749984858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/ece5a7c63e2448af99d85b79099ad444.mp4?t=1749984858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mining:</strong> Using good lasers takes a lot of energy. To upgrade the player and your battery, you'll have to dig for ores and minerals and craft new items!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/b7c366853b0803bd2bc805d834f6f29e.poster.avif?t=1749984858\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/b7c366853b0803bd2bc805d834f6f29e.webm?t=1749984858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595480/extras/b7c366853b0803bd2bc805d834f6f29e.mp4?t=1749984858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
